Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince and Qiqi flew and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,flew,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,still on their way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They passed by a very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,bright planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There were so many
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,sparkles everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,did the stars fall down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi opened her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't stars at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a man wearing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,very shiny clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With a super big hat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The hat was so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it was dazzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The man kept asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,answered politely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then clap for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,More, more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The man shouted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,excitedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi curiously tried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,on that big hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When she put it on,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,a big mirror appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:00:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:00:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the mirror only
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,showed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When Qiqi clapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,only she could hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When Qiqi said how beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,only she answered
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi pouted and took
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the hat off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Praising yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,alone is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince thought and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,said: I have a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I praise her every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and she praises me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When you praise others,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll praise you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.63,0:01:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The man kept looking in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the mirror endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Praise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.17,0:01:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Praise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he shouted loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody passed by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi whispered to the Little Prince: Only
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.49,0:01:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,looking at yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that be lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince nodded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They held hands and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,gently flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The man was still shouting:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody could hear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,who do you like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to praise?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go praise your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,best friend
